WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.310
Speaker 1: Yesterday was truly a day for the
history books in the United States.

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:13.290
There aren't that many days every decade,
never mind century like what we saw yesterday.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:19.590
The failed former President Donald Trump was
arrested, booked, indicted and pleaded not

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:28.470
guilty for 37 felony counts, was instructed
not to be in contact with any other defendants

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:34.760
nor witnesses, a requirement which he immediately
broke last night.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:39.059
Trump then flew back to his Bedminster, New
Jersey, golf resort.

00:00:39.059 --> 00:00:46.559
I think it is where he actually admitted to
some of the crimes that he is accused of,

00:00:46.559 --> 00:00:51.989
despite claiming total innocence and claiming
that he didn't do anything.

00:00:51.989 --> 00:00:58.410
And we now move into two different new phases,
the pretrial phase with this latest federal

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:05.019
indictment, as well as the waiting game for
what may be a second federal indictment for

00:01:05.019 --> 00:01:11.360
Trump's role in the January six Trump riots
and a state indictment out of the state of

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:18.890
Georgia for Trump's attempt to incorrectly
fraudulently, illegally overturn the correct

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:25.829
results from Georgia in 2020, in which now
President Joe Biden won the popular vote of

00:01:25.829 --> 00:01:30.340
Georgia and subsequently the electoral votes
from Georgia.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:32.659
So let's start at the beginning.

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:39.920
The Miami Herald reporting Trump sits silently
in Miami Courtroom Pleads Not Guilty in Historic

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:41.299
Case.

00:01:41.299 --> 00:01:46.049
Former President Donald Trump pleaded not
guilty Tuesday in Miami federal court to a

00:01:46.049 --> 00:01:52.390
37 count indictment, accusing him of deliberately
keeping at his Palm Beach state government

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:58.600
documents that contained highly sensitive
defense weapons and nuclear information and

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:03.640
of obstructing efforts by U.S. authorities
to reclaim them in a packed courtroom.

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:05.740
And remember, there were no cameras in the
courtroom.

00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:07.930
So all we have are these descriptions.

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:13.400
In a packed courtroom, Trump and Trump entered
his plea in a historic case marking the first

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:19.300
federal prosecution of a former president
and a potential hurdle in his renewed quest

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:22.420
for the presidency in the 2024 election.

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:27.261
Trump's lawyer, Todd Blanch, representing
Trump alongside Chris Keys, said, quote, We

00:02:27.261 --> 00:02:31.840
most certainly enter a plea of not guilty.

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:34.670
Trump was arraigned a day before his 77th
birthday.

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:36.819
That will be relevant later as well.

00:02:36.819 --> 00:02:39.909
Appearing before Magistrate Judge Jonathan
Goodman.

00:02:39.909 --> 00:02:44.140
Trump said nothing during the 45 minute proceeding.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:47.940
Prosecutor David Harbach told the judge his
team would prepare a list of witnesses with

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:51.360
whom Trump cannot communicate about the case
before the trial.

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:55.910
Trump was released on his own recognizance
with no monetary bond and no travel restrictions.

00:02:55.910 --> 00:03:01.520
So I think it's important to mention one of
the reasons that this indictment generally

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:10.159
is important is that we want a justice system
that doesn't have exceptions where no one

00:03:10.159 --> 00:03:11.769
is above the law.

00:03:11.769 --> 00:03:17.740
And despite what you're hearing from the maggots,
Macedonians, MAGA, paté, Mayans, whatever

00:03:17.740 --> 00:03:19.159
you want to call them.

00:03:19.159 --> 00:03:23.190
Despite what you're hearing from them, that
this is evidence of a two tiered justice system

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:24.569
in a bad way.

00:03:24.569 --> 00:03:27.349
In fact, we know we have a two tiered justice
system.

00:03:27.349 --> 00:03:32.180
Trump being indicted is maybe a slight half
step in the direction of no one is above the

00:03:32.180 --> 00:03:33.180
law.

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:39.580
However, there still are favorite isms that
are being given to Trump, including the fact

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:44.730
that he was released on his own recognizance
with no monetary bond as well as no travel

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:45.790
restrictions.

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:49.690
Many other defendants, not former presidents
of the United States.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:55.080
By the way, individuals without private jets
with which they could fly anywhere at any

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:59.590
time would have been given a monetary bond
and may have had travel restrictions put in

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:00.590
place.

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:02.200
So just something to keep in mind.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:08.239
The Associated Press also reporting they have
an interesting drawing of what the scene in

00:04:08.239 --> 00:04:10.269
the courtroom looked like.

00:04:10.269 --> 00:04:17.120
Trump reportedly looking glum and having his
arms crossed at many moments during this,

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:22.990
writes, Trump approached his arraignment with
characteristic bravado, posting social media

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:30.449
broadsides against the prosecution from inside
his motorcade en route to the courthouse and

00:04:30.449 --> 00:04:35.360
insisting that he has done nothing wrong and
was being persecuted for political purposes.

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:37.400
We are going to discuss that.

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:43.039
But the article writes Inside the courtroom,
he sat silently, scowling and arms crossed

00:04:43.039 --> 00:04:47.690
as a lawyer entered a not guilty plea on his
behalf in a brief arraignment that ended without

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:51.590
him having to surrender his passport, etc.,
etc.

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:56.389
Always in campaign mode, he swiftly pivoted
from a solemn courtroom to a festive restaurant,

00:04:56.389 --> 00:04:58.320
stopping on his way out of Miami.

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:02.920
At Vici, an iconic Cuban spot where listen,
we'll talk about this later.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:05.150
But they sang Happy birthday to Trump.

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:11.520
Trump turning 77 today and also prayed over
Trump, which was really quite a scene.

